      "source": "<dt>Type Parameters:</dt>\n<dd><span id=\"map(java.util.function.Function)-type-param-R\"><code>R</code> - </span></dd>\n<dt>Parameters:</dt>\n<dd><code>mapper</code> - must not be null. If the mapper returns null, then the boundary value\n         corresponds with <a href=\"#unbounded()\"><code>unbounded()</code></a>.</dd>\n<dt>Returns:</dt>\n<dd>a new <a href=\"Range.Bound.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Range.Bound</code></a> after applying the value to the mapper.</dd>\n<dt>Since:</dt>\n<dd>3.0</dd>",
      "translation": "<dt>类型参数：</dt>\n<dd><span id=\"map(java.util.function.Function)-type-param-R\"><code>R</code> - </span></dd>\n<dt>参数：</dt>\n<dd><code>mapper</code> - 不能为 null。如果 mapper 返回 null，则边界值对应于 <a href=\"#unbounded()\"><code>unbounded()</code></a>。</dd>\n<dt>返回：</dt>\n<dd>应用该值到 mapper 后生成的新的 <a href=\"Range.Bound.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Range.Bound</code></a>。</dd>\n<dt>版本：</dt>\n<dd>3.0</dd>",
